Z||000005||pherder||11-21-2001||09:18 PM||||Sorry, no pictures but do have a little more info on the car.<P>It was stretched ~10" and chopped ~3"  The exact length of the stretch was the length of the vents since I think he had two sets on either side!<P>It went pass a place the North Texas Fieros was having a meeting and we all tried flagging it down.  It did return and we got a better look at it.<P>He did a great job on it considering it wasn't done at a shop.  The only thing missing was an engine upgrade (at the time) ... it still had the 2.5L4!!!<P>Paul (ex NTF member)||||reg||1
